---
source: crates/weglarka-daemon/src/bootstrap.rs
expression: "plan.to_string().replace(dir.path().to_str().unwrap(), \"[root]\")"
---
 1. create host directory [root]/host
 2. install launcher from [root]/src-launcher
 3. enable linger for weglarka
 4. install generation sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (daemon [root]/src-daemon, cli [root]/src-cli)
 5. retire legacy self-update/watchdog units and lock
 6. import legacy self-update state and retire the file
 7. select generation sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa (epoch 1)
 8. write host capabilities
 9. install launcher jobs: update, watchdog
10. install service pinned to ghcr.io/example/weglarka@sha256:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
11. apply host directory ownership (uid 1001, gid 1001)
12. preflight the active and recovery generation
13. write the bootstrap-complete marker
14. apply host directory ownership (uid 1001, gid 1001)
